\ A case branch whose body is itself uncompilable interpreter-free (it
\ constructs a quotation at runtime via `>quotation`). The branch quotation is
\ discovered in the composite table and assigned a slot, but its body has no
\ compiled code_ptr, so dispatching to it cannot fall back to an absent
\ interpreter. The compiled dynamic `call` aborts cleanly at runtime with a
\ defined error rather than re-entering an absent interpreter.
1 { { 1 [ "double" >quotation call ] } } case
